OL,6,GFar-right activist Tommy Robinson    W5
OL,7,Ghas been charged with failing to     W5
OL,8,Gprovide his phone's pin code to      W5
OL,9,Gpolice at Heathrow Airport.          W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GThe alleged incident happened when   W5
OL,12,GRobinson, whose real name is Stephen W5
OL,13,GYaxley-Lennon, was detained after    W5
OL,14,Greturning to the UK from Russia via  W5
OL,15,GTurkey on 13 June this year.         W5
OL,16,                                      W5
OL,17,GThe 43-year-old is due to appear at  W5
OL,18,GWestminster Magistrates' Court on 14 W5
OL,19,GDecember, the Metropolitan Police    W5
OL,20,Gsaid.                                W5
